      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In the case of neuropathic pain, clinical symptoms are not in proportion to the initial lesion. Its detection is based on the detailed description given by the patient, and on a meticulous clinical examination. Its treatment has many facets, from medication to multi-dimensional therapies."},
